## 🚀 3. Essential Commands to Know
If your evaluators ask you how to run or debug the platform, here are your commands:

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **To Start the Dashboard Server:**
> Always run this exact command from your main SecureDocker root directory. *Never use the standard Python "play" button!*
> ```bash
> python -m streamlit run dashboard/app.py
> ```

> [!TIP]
> **To Verify Database State Manually (for debugging):**
> ```bash
> sqlite3 securedocker.db
> sqlite> SELECT * FROM images;
> sqlite> SELECT * FROM scan_results;
> ```

> [!NOTE]
> **To Run a Background Vulnerability Engine Update Manually:**
> Your system uses Trivy under the hood. To ensure you have the absolute latest global hacking database available before your presentation:
> ```bash
> trivy image --download-db-only
> ```

